<%= partial :'accounts/nav' %>
<div class="container">
  <p>Your API key connects Dandelion to <a href="/docs/integrations">Zapier and AI assistants</a>. Anyone with it can act as you, so keep it secret. It's replaced when you change your email or password.</p>
  <div class="mb-3">
    <label class="form-label" for="api_key">API key</label>
    <input type="text" id="api_key" class="form-control" value="<%= @account.api_key %>" readonly onclick="this.select()">
  </div>
</div>
